{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NKhaSdBipteSu8sRxcMmFs","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"TypeScript compiler latest version npm 2026\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"typescript on NPM | Release Alert\",\"url\":\"https://releasealert.dev/npmjs/_/typescript\"},{\"title\":\"typescript - npm\",\"url\":\"https://www.npmjs.com/package/typescript\"},{\"title\":\"Announcing TypeScript 6.0 - TypeScript\",\"url\":\"https://devblogs.microsoft.com/typescript/announcing-typescript-6-0/\"},{\"title\":\"Announcing TypeScript 7.0 RC - TypeScript\",\"url\":\"https://devblogs.microsoft.com/typescript/announcing-typescript-7-0-rc/\"},{\"title\":\"Releases · microsoft/TypeScript\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/microsoft/typescript/releases\"},{\"title\":\"TypeScript\",\"url\":\"https://devblogs.microsoft.com/typescript/\"},{\"title\":\"TypeScript 7.0 Beta Arrives on Go-Based Foundation With 10x Speed Claim -- Visual Studio Magazine\",\"url\":\"https://visualstudiomagazine.com/articles/2026/04/21/typescript-7-0-beta-arrives-on-go-based-foundation-with-10x-speed-claim.aspx\"},{\"title\":\"TypeScript 7.0 RC: The Go-Native Compiler Has Landed\",\"url\":\"https://www.digitalapplied.com/blog/typescript-7-0-rc-go-native-compiler-2026-upgrade-guide\"},{\"title\":\"TypeScript: How to set up TypeScript\",\"url\":\"https://www.typescriptlang.org/download/\"},{\"title\":\"Npm\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Npm\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about the TypeScript compiler's latest version on npm:\n\nThe latest stable version of TypeScript is 7.0.2, last published 2 months ago. Additionally, there is a development version 7.1.0-dev.20260825.1 that was published on August 25, 2026.\n\nTypeScript 7.0 was released as an RC on June 18, 2026, and with a combination of native code speed and shared memory parallelism, TypeScript 7.0 is often about 10 times faster than TypeScript 6.0. The codebase was ported from TypeScript (as a bootstrapped codebase that compiles to JavaScript) over to Go.\n\nYou can install TypeScript from npm using the command: `npm i typescript`\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f8a589dc-0514-4f0e-8052-c158309f0e6a","uuid":"fd53f9b7-1a93-4c61-9623-6843a9ea3029","timestamp":"2026-09-04T08:47:12.985Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"TypeScript compiler latest version npm 2026","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01PaRv9WsFGmj7onwbeyXTHJ","content":[{"title":"typescript on NPM | Release Alert","url":"https://releasealert.dev/npmjs/_/typescript"},{"title":"typescript - npm","url":"https://www.npmjs.com/package/typescript"},{"title":"Announcing TypeScript 6.0 - TypeScript","url":"https://devblogs.microsoft.com/typescript/announcing-typescript-6-0/"},{"title":"Announcing TypeScript 7.0 RC - TypeScript","url":"https://devblogs.microsoft.com/typescript/announcing-typescript-7-0-rc/"},{"title":"Releases · microsoft/TypeScript","url":"https://github.com/microsoft/typescript/releases"},{"title":"TypeScript","url":"https://devblogs.microsoft.com/typescript/"},{"title":"TypeScript 7.0 Beta Arrives on Go-Based Foundation With 10x Speed Claim -- Visual Studio Magazine","url":"https://visualstudiomagazine.com/articles/2026/04/21/typescript-7-0-beta-arrives-on-go-based-foundation-with-10x-speed-claim.aspx"},{"title":"TypeScript 7.0 RC: The Go-Native Compiler Has Landed","url":"https://www.digitalapplied.com/blog/typescript-7-0-rc-go-native-compiler-2026-upgrade-guide"},{"title":"TypeScript: How to set up TypeScript","url":"https://www.typescriptlang.org/download/"},{"title":"Npm","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Npm"}]},"Based on the search results, here's what I found about the TypeScript compiler's latest version on npm:\n\nThe latest stable version of TypeScript is 7.0.2, last published 2 months ago. Additionally, there is a development version 7.1.0-dev.20260825.1 that was published on August 25, 2026.\n\nTypeScript 7.0 was released as an RC on June 18, 2026, and with a combination of native code speed and shared memory parallelism, TypeScript 7.0 is often about 10 times faster than TypeScript 6.0. The codebase was ported from TypeScript (as a bootstrapped codebase that compiles to JavaScript) over to Go.\n\nYou can install TypeScript from npm using the command: `npm i typescript`"],"durationSeconds":5.151476999999999,"searchCount":1}}
